cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "im_hobo"
abstract: >-
  Python pipeline that performs QA/QC on CSV files exported from Onset HOBO
  data loggers, producing timezone-corrected, unit-converted, timestep-
  synchronized output files (CSV, TOA5, and Parquet) ready for import into
  analysis workflows such as the GCE Data Toolbox.
